{"id":880342,"title":"08｜RAG构建金融知识库","content":"本节课介绍了RAG（检索增强生成）技术及其在金融领域的应用。RAG通过结合检索与生成，利用外部知识库提升大语言模型的准确性、实时性和可解释性。课程分为三部分：首先介绍RAG的基本原理和优势，如扩展背景知识、提高内容可信度等；接着演示从环境准备到数据构建的全过程，包括数据搜集、清洗、标准化及向量数据库的构建；最后通过实际案例展示RAG系统的搭建步骤，包括开发环境配置、数据处理、向量数据库构建、检索参数设置等。实战环节使用DeepSeek R1 7b模型，展示了如何构建一个金融知识库并进行问答推理。最终证明了RAG技术能够显著提升生成答案的质量，并解决大模型幻觉问题。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":405082,"user_name":"Roway","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1060967,"ip_address":"陕西","ucode":"65AF589142AB6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/30/67/a1e9aaba.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769871292,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101048901,"comment_content":"怎么没人回答问题？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":402581,"user_name":"刘","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3932959,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"329451B563C224","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3c/03/1f/4efa4f2d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1758437062,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048901,"comment_content":"课程资料可以提供吗？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401779,"user_name":"Geek_34cc02","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3867814,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"D3F8E9AB600B21","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753768426,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048901,"comment_content":"课程资料怎么找","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401460,"user_name":"吴十一","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1658932,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"47232ED3225081","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/50/34/172342fd.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1752196573,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048901,"comment_content":"请问代码在哪里可以下载吗","like_count":0}]}